00:57:53,684 --> 00:57:59,684
Dead in Tombstone is a 2013 American direct-to-video horror
Western film produced by Universal 1440 Entertainment.

12
01:03:09,473 --> 01:03:15,473
It was directed by Roel Reiné and written by Shane Kuhn and Brendan Cowles.

13
01:08:25,263 --> 01:08:31,263
The film stars Danny Trejo as Guerrero, a gang leader who
gets double-crossed by his fellow gang members.

14
01:13:41,052 --> 01:13:47,052
Striking a pact with the Devil after entering Hell, he resurfaces to the earthly
world to avenge his own death by killing the men who murdered him.

15
01:18:56,842 --> 01:19:02,842
The film was released in home media on October 22, 2013, and was
followed by a sequel, Dead Again in Tombstone (2017).

16
01:24:12,631 --> 01:24:18,631
The film is based on the concept of the deal with the Devil.

17
01:29:28,421 --> 01:29:34,421
The film explores themes of saloon, supernatural, forced labour, hell, revenge.

18
01:34:44,210 --> 01:34:50,210
The tone is dark and emotional.
